@page
@model wedding_website.Pages.EventModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Information";
}

<section class="section-background text-center">
    <h1>Jane & Joe's forever begins</h1>
    <div class="text-section">
        <p class="text-under-title">Saturday, June 20, 2027</p>
        <p>
            We are delighted to invite you to celebrate the wedding of Jane and Joe.<br />
            Join us for a beautiful day filled with love, laughter, good food, music, and wonderful memories.
        </p>
        <h3>The ceremony</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Time:</strong> 3:00 PM<br />
            <strong>Location:</strong> Rosewood Estate<br />
            <strong>Address:</strong> 18 Willow Lane, Hampshire, England<br />
            The ceremony will take place outdoors in the estate's beautiful garden, surrounded by flowers and old oak trees. <br />
            Guests are kindly asked to arrive at least 30 minutes before the ceremony begins.
        </p>
        <h3>The reception</h3>
        <p>
            Following the ceremony, we will continue the celebrations with drinks, dinner, speeches,
            and dancing in the main hall at Rosewood Estate.<br />
            <strong>Reception begins:</strong> 4:30 PM <br />
            <strong>Dinner:</strong> 6:00 PM <br />
            <strong>First dance:</strong> 8:30 PM <br />
            <strong>Celebrations:</strong> Until late <br />
            There will be plenty of time throughout the afternoon and evening to relax, enjoy a drink, take photographs, and celebrate together.
        </p>

        <h3>Dress code</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Garden formal</strong><br />
            We would love for our guests to dress elegantly while still being comfortable enough to enjoy an outdoor celebration.<br />

            Ladies may choose dresses, jumpsuits, or elegant separates, while gentlemen may wear suits or smart formal attire. 
            Since part of the celebration will take place outdoors, comfortable shoes are recommended.<br />

            Most importantly, wear something that makes you feel wonderful!
        </p>

        <h3>Where to stay</h3>
        <p>
            For guests travelling from out of town, there are several hotels and charming bed & breakfasts within a short drive of the venue.<br />

            We recommend booking your accommodation early, especially if you are planning to stay for the entire weekend. <br />

            A shuttle service will be available between selected accommodation locations and Rosewood Estate before and after the wedding, 
            so guests can enjoy the evening without worrying about driving.
        </p>

        <h3>Gifts</h3>
        <p>
            Having you with us on our wedding day is the greatest gift we could ask for.<br />

            If you would still like to give us something, we would be incredibly grateful for a contribution towards our honeymoon and 
            future adventures together. There will also be a small gift table at the reception for anyone who prefers to bring a physical gift.<br />

            Your love and presence mean more to us than anything else.
        </p>

        <h3>Photography</h3>
        <p>
            We want everyone to feel free to enjoy the day, so we have a wonderful photographer capturing all the important moments.<br />

            Guests are more than welcome to take photographs throughout the day. During the ceremony, however, we kindly ask that you keep phones 
            and cameras away so everyone can be fully present for the moment.<br />

            After the ceremony, we'll have plenty of opportunities for photos with family and friends.<br />

            A private online photo gallery will be shared after the wedding, where you will be able to see and download the professional photographs.
        </p>

        <h3>RSVP</h3>
        <p>
            Please let us know if you are able to join us by April 1, 2027.<br />

            When responding, please include any dietary requirements, and whether you require transportation from one of the recommended hotels.<br />

            We hope you can celebrate with us!
        </p>
    </div>

</section>